OL,3,GNEWSADouble jeopardy killer cringes at
OL,4,Apast, panel told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murderer jailed after his victim's
OL,7,Ffamily got the double jeopardy law
OL,8,Fchanged has told the Parole Board he is
OL,9,Fready for prison release and "cringes"
OL,10,Fat the "selfish" violent man he was.
OL,12,FWilliam Dunlop, now 63, strangled Julie
OL,13,FHogg, 22, before "sexually mutilating"
OL,14,Fher body and hiding her beneath her
OL,15,Fbath in Billingham, near Middlesbrough,
OL,16,Fin 1989.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
