OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADouble jeopardy killer cringes at
OL,4,Apast, panel told
OL,5,
OL,6,FJuries twice failed to find him guilty
OL,7,Fbut after he made confessions to a
OL,8,Fprison guard, Julie Hogg's family
OL,9,Fcampaigned for him to be prosecuted
OL,10,Fagain, leading to him admitting murder
OL,11,Fand being jailed for life with a
OL,12,Fminimum term of 17 years in 2006.
OL,14,FAt a new hearing, Dunlop's fourth
OL,15,Fattempt at parole, his victim's family
OL,16,Fsaid he should stay in jail.
